MosDNS dynamic DNS forwarder with pf table sync

Native OPNsense MVC plugin (no Go controller). Manages mosdns
(nxovaeng/mosdns-pf fork) as the local DNS engine and the pf-aliasd
daemon, which feeds resolved A/AAAA records into FreeBSD pf tables
with TTL expiry, driving domain-based policy routing.

Both services are independently enablable. mosdns listens on
127.0.0.1:5353 by default; split-horizon forwarding (direct / proxy
via SOCKS5) is configured from the UI.

WWW: https://github.com/nxovaeng/nxova-opn-repo
